"use": "区民センター (a downtown civic centre, busy): four storeys 48 x 32 m -- F1 two entrances with 風除室, the information desk, the 窓口 counters (住民票 / 戸籍) with the ticket machine and waiting rows, a cafe corner; F2 the multi-purpose hall (0.9 m stage, rows of seats) and four meeting rooms; F3 the library (stacks, reading tables); F4 the offices, the director, the 防災センター (monitors). Four corner stairs (one to the roof), a lift bank, WC blocks per floor. A smaller one for the residential districts is the library's Civic_WardOffice placeholder. probe_xz is on the plaza side of the hall. kits/interiors/CivicCenter.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
